  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 1038874977809204475
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Do not move. The light is perfect.
    - rid: 1128559268157251915
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Perfect. Now everyone can watch it become something special.
    - rid: 4262678690755085691
      type: {class: ImageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: af8ee6cccf0105543afac3ac803bd832, type: 3}
    - rid: 4326934440167873402
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: You usually ask before photographing people.
    - rid: 4383310151548326243
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And you are?
    - rid: 5818870836215511659
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: People love good coffee.
    - rid: 5899159953271161006
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The house is far from finished.
    - rid: 6703653003857722052
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: They love a comeback story even more.
    - rid: 6975438485012862505
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Sofia Reyes. Photographer, local business enthusiast, and the reason
          your coffee stand has been appearing all over the neighborhood feed.
    - rid: 7823905754763434989
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I photographed the coffee. Maya happened to be standing behind it.
    - rid: 8407529653694559886
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Excuse me?
    - rid: 8781691080150891819
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Excellent. That is exactly the photo I needed.
    - rid: 9095842370848584541
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: You posted about us?
